{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1774028977,"nonce":"BvZydq43L4rBRHCFcbuPr/TDUGc=","title":"P2: Activity monitor fixes — last_active, SDK processing, idle, periodic discovery","message":"Parent: f3dbb3e\n\nFix activity monitor gaps identified in the audit.\n\n## 1. Write last_active\n- SDK backend: update sessions.last_active on every assistant/tool_use stream event\n- PTY backend: stat the JSONL transcript file periodically, update last_active\n- In SessionRegistry: add updateLastActive(sessionId, timestamp) method\n\n## 2. Expose SDK processing state\n- SDKBackend: when processPromptQueue starts processing, update the linked Mandible session status to active\n- When queue drains (processing=false), update status to idle\n- This uses the existing idle status that is type-defined but never set\n\n## 3. Activate idle status\n- SessionRegistry: add setIdle(sessionId) method\n- SDKBackend.processPromptQueue finally block: after setting this.processing=false, if session has a mandible_session_id, call registry.setIdle()\n- SDKBackend.processPromptQueue start: call registry.setActive()\n\n## 4. Make discovery periodic\n- Add SessionDiscovery.discoverSessions() to the ReaperTimer interval (every 60s), or a separate timer at lower frequency (every 5 min)\n- Guard against discovery running while already in progress (mutex/flag)\n\n## 5. Add Gemini to agent patterns\n- In session-discovery.ts AGENT_PATTERNS: add { pattern: /gemini/, app: \"gemini\" }\n\n## 6. Index sessions by branch\n- Migration: CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS sessions_branch_idx ON sessions(branch) WHERE branch IS NOT NULL","files":null}]}